WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.568
We are going to the playground. Here is what will happen.

2
00:00:05.568 --> 00:00:09.000
We arrive at the playground gate.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.552
We look around to see what is free: swings, slide, climbing frame.

4
00:00:15.552 --> 00:00:20.256
We wait our turn if someone is on the swing we want.

5
00:00:20.256 --> 00:00:26.856
We can say: can I have a turn next? That sentence works.

6
00:00:26.856 --> 00:00:32.232
We play for a while, then we take a water break on the bench.

7
00:00:32.232 --> 00:00:36.792
When it is time to go, we say goodbye and leave.

8
00:00:36.792 --> 00:00:41.616
All done. Playground time finished.

9
00:00:41.616 --> 00:00:49.824
All done. Now you know what will happen. You can watch this again any time.

